<div><h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px">Before your batch starts</h2><p>If you cancel in writing to <a href="mailto:finance@cokonet.com">finance@cokonet.com</a> before your batch begins, you are eligible for a refund of fees paid, less any payment-gateway charges and a processing fee communicated by your counsellor at enrolment.</p><p>If Cokonet cancels or indefinitely postpones a batch you enrolled in, you receive a full refund or a free transfer to the next batch, your choice.</p></div>
<div><h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px">After classes begin</h2><p>Refund eligibility after classes begin depends on the terms agreed with your counsellor for your specific programme and is generally limited once a substantial portion of live sessions or materials has been delivered. Batch transfers and course changes are usually available as alternatives; ask learner support first.</p><p>Scholarship-discounted fees, one-time offers and completed programmes are non-refundable unless required by law.</p></div>
<div><h2 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px">How refunds are processed</h2><p>Approved refunds are returned to the original payment method through Razorpay, normally within 7 to 10 working days of approval. Write to <a href="mailto:finance@cokonet.com">finance@cokonet.com</a> with your name, phone number, enrolment reference and payment reference to start a request.</p><p>If you believe a payment was made in error or without authorisation, contact us immediately at +91 90486 66140 and we will investigate with the payment gateway.</p></div>
